 # merge_group or push trigger (quality/catalog.yml `lane: full`, and the catalog check enforces it). It runs after a push to main
 # whose FAST run finished green (a workflow_run of CI), or by hand for a commit (the release train dispatches it for one it wants
 # to publish). Every job tests the commit the FAST run passed on, never the branch tip. A newer push cancels an older run: the
